{"title":"Première conversation","ts":"2026-10-11T19:53:54.973Z","msgs":[{"id":"zyk8z2qu2a","role":"user","text":"salut","apiText":"salut","attachments":[],"ts":"2026-10-11T19:53:36.178Z","hidden":false},{"id":"4c4vdfqu5x","role":"bot","thinking":false,"text":"Bonjour. Comment puis-je vous aider aujourd'hui ?","ts":"2026-10-11T19:53:36.309Z","accumulatedThink":"","sources":[],"steps":[{"id":"step-reflect-0","name":"Réflexion","summary":"Je réponds simplement à la salutation pour engager la conversation.","status":"done","details":"Je réponds simplement à la salutation pour engager la conversation."}],"reflectionStartTs":1791748416309,"codeBlocks":[],"typing":false,"apiHidden":true},{"id":"mp4kfvr8k9","role":"user","text":"codé un jeu","apiText":"codé un jeu","attachments":[],"ts":"2026-10-11T19:53:54.969Z","hidden":false},{"id":"00dp31r8kj","role":"bot","thinking":false,"text":"Je crée un jeu de plateforme complet et interactif, avec des graphismes épurés, des obstacles dynamiques, un système de score et un design responsive.\n\n\n\nLe jeu est prêt et s'affiche sous forme de page web interactive avec des contrôles fluides, des plateformes, des pièces à collecter et des pièges.","ts":"2026-10-11T19:53:54.979Z","accumulatedThink":"","sources":[],"steps":[{"id":"step-reflect-0","name":"Réflexion","summary":"Je crée un jeu de type platformer arcade en HTML, CSS et JavaScript avec un style visuel moderne et des animations fluides.","status":"done","details":"Je crée un jeu de type platformer arcade en HTML, CSS et JavaScript avec un style visuel moderne et des animations fluides."}],"reflectionStartTs":1791748434979,"_planDone":true,"intro":"Je comprends votre demande et je vais coder un jeu web interactif et complet, doté d'un design soigné et d'un gameplay fluide, directement livrable dans notre discussion.","codeBlocks":[{"lang":"html","filename":"index.html","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"fr\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Jeu de Plateforme Arcade</title>\n    <style>\n        * {\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n        }\n        body {\n            background: #0f172a;\n            color: #f8fafc;\n            font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            min-height: 100vh;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n        h1 {\n            font-size: 1.8rem;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n            letter-spacing: 1px;\n            color: #38bdf8;\n        }\n        .game-container {\n            position: relative;\n            box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), 0 10px 10px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            border: 2px solid #334155;\n        }\n        canvas {\n            display: block;\n            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #1e293b, #0f172a);\n        }\n        .ui-panel {\n            margin-top: 15px;\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 20px;\n            font-size: 1.1rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n        }\n        .ui-badge {\n            background: #1e293b;\n            padding: 8px 16px;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n            border: 1px solid #334155;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);\n        }\n        .controls-hint {\n            margin-top: 10px;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            color: #94a3b8;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n    <h1>Neon Runner</h1>\n    \n    <div class=\"game-container\">\n        <canvas id=\"gameCanvas\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\"></canvas>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"ui-panel\">\n        <div class=\"ui-badge\">Score : <span id=\"scoreVal\">0</span></div>\n        <div class=\"ui-badge\">Vies : <span id=\"livesVal\">3</span></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"controls-hint\">\n        Utilisez les flèches <strong>GAUCHE / DROITE</strong> pour vous déplacer, et <strong>ESPACE</strong> ou <strong>HAUT</strong> pour sauter.\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('gameCanvas');\n        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n\n        const scoreEl = document.getElementById('scoreVal');\n        const livesEl = document.getElementById('livesVal');\n\n        let score = 0;\n        let lives = 3;\n        let gameRunning = true;\n\n        const player = {\n            x: 100,\n            y: 300,\n            width: 30,\n            height: 40,\n            vx: 0,\n            vy: 0,\n            speed: 5,\n            jumpForce: -12,\n            gravity: 0.6,\n            grounded: false,\n            color: '#38bdf8'\n        };\n\n        const keys = {\n            left: false,\n            right: false,\n            up: false\n        };\n\n        const platforms = [\n            { x: 0, y: 400, width: 800, height: 50, color: '#334155' },\n            { x: 200, y: 300, width: 150, height: 20, color: '#475569' },\n            { x: 450, y: 220, width: 180, height: 20, color: '#475569' },\n            { x: 100, y: 160, width: 120, height: 20, color: '#475569' }\n        ];\n\n        const collectibles = [\n            { x: 260, y: 260, width: 15, height: 15, collected: false, color: '#facc15' },\n            { x: 520, y: 180, width: 15, height: 15, collected: false, color: '#facc15' },\n            { x: 150, y: 120, width: 15, height: 15, collected: false, color: '#facc15' },\n            { x: 700, y: 350, width: 15, height: 15, collected: false, color: '#facc15' }\n        ];\n\n        const hazards = [\n            { x: 350, y: 380, width: 40, height: 20, color: '#ef4444' },\n            { x: 600, y: 380, width: 40, height: 20, color: '#ef4444' }\n        ];\n\n        window.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n            if (e.code === 'ArrowLeft' || e.code === 'KeyA') keys.left = true;\n            if (e.code === 'ArrowRight' || e.code === 'KeyD') keys.right = true;\n            if (e.code === 'ArrowUp' || e.code === 'Space' || e.code === 'KeyW') {\n                if (player.grounded) {\n                    player.vy = player.jumpForce;\n                    player.grounded = false;\n                }\n                keys.up = true;\n                e.preventDefault();\n            }\n        });\n\n        window.addEventListener('keyup', (e) => {\n            if (e.code === 'ArrowLeft' || e.code === 'KeyA') keys.left = false;\n            if (e.code === 'ArrowRight' || e.code === 'KeyD') keys.right = false;\n            if (e.code === 'ArrowUp' || e.code === 'Space' || e.code === 'KeyW') keys.up = false;\n        });\n\n        function resetPlayer() {\n            player.x = 100;\n            player.y = 300;\n            player.vx = 0;\n            player.vy = 0;\n            player.grounded = false;\n        }\n\n        function checkCollision(rect1, rect2) {\n            return rect1.x < rect2.x + rect2.width &&\n                   rect1.x + rect1.width > rect2.x &&\n                   rect1.y < rect2.y + rect2.height &&\n                   rect1.y + rect1.height > rect2.y;\n        }\n\n        function update() {\n            if (!gameRunning) return;\n\n            // Mouvements horizontaux\n            if (keys.left) {\n                player.vx = -player.speed;\n            } else if (keys.right) {\n                player.vx = player.speed;\n            } else {\n                player.vx = 0;\n            }\n\n            player.x += player.vx;\n\n            // Limites de l'écran (gauche/droite)\n            if (player.x < 0) player.x = 0;\n            if (player.x + player.width > canvas.width) player.x = canvas.width - player.width;\n\n            // Gravité et mouvements verticaux\n            player.vy += player.gravity;\n            player.y += player.vy;\n            player.grounded = false;\n\n            // Collisions avec les plateformes\n            platforms.forEach(plat => {\n                // Collision par le dessus\n                if (player.x < plat.x + plat.width &&\n                    player.x + player.width > plat.x &&\n                    player.y + player.height >= plat.y &&\n                    player.y + player.height - player.vy <= plat.y + 10 &&\n                    player.vy >= 0) {\n                    player.y = plat.y - player.height;\n                    player.vy = 0;\n                    player.grounded = true;\n                }\n            });\n\n            // Collisions avec les objets à collecter\n            collectibles.forEach(item => {\n                if (!item.collected && checkCollision(player, item)) {\n                    item.collected = true;\n                    score += 100;\n                    scoreEl.textContent = score;\n                }\n            });\n\n            // Collisions avec les pièges\n            hazards.forEach(hazard => {\n                if (checkCollision(player, hazard)) {\n                    lives--;\n                    livesEl.textContent = lives;\n                    if (lives <= 0) {\n                        gameRunning = false;\n                    } else {\n                        resetPlayer();\n                    }\n                }\n            });\n\n            // Respawn si chute hors écran\n            if (player.y > canvas.height) {\n                lives--;\n                livesEl.textContent = lives;\n                if (lives <= 0) {\n                    gameRunning = false;\n                } else {\n                    resetPlayer();\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        function draw() {\n            ctx.clearRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);\n\n            // Dessiner les plateformes\n            platforms.forEach(plat => {\n                ctx.fillStyle = plat.color;\n                ctx.fillRect(plat.x, plat.y, plat.width, plat.height);\n            });\n\n            // Dessiner les objets\n            collectibles.forEach(item => {\n                if (!item.collected) {\n                    ctx.fillStyle = item.color;\n                    ctx.beginPath();\n                    ctx.arc(item.x + item.width / 2, item.y + item.height / 2, item.width / 2, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n                    ctx.fill();\n                }\n            });\n\n            // Dessiner les pièges\n            hazards.forEach(hazard => {\n                ctx.fillStyle = hazard.color;\n                ctx.fillRect(hazard.x, hazard.y, hazard.width, hazard.height);\n            });\n\n            // Dessiner le joueur\n            ctx.fillStyle = player.color;\n            ctx.fillRect(player.x, player.y, player.width, player.height);\n\n            // Écran de fin de partie\n            if (!gameRunning) {\n                ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.85)';\n                ctx.fillRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);\n\n                ctx.fillStyle = '#f8fafc';\n                ctx.font = 'bold 32px system-ui';\n                ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n                ctx.fillText('FIN DE PARTIE', canvas.width / 2, canvas.height / 2 - 20);\n\n                ctx.font = '18px system-ui';\n                ctx.fillStyle = '#94a3b8';\n                ctx.fillText('Actualisez la page pour rejouer', canvas.width / 2, canvas.height / 2 + 20);\n                ctx.textAlign = 'left';\n            }\n        }\n\n        function loop() {\n            update();\n            draw();\n            requestAnimationFrame(loop);\n        }\n\n        loop();\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>"}],"typing":false,"apiHidden":true},{"id":"zi28b7rad0","role":"bot","hidden":true,"text":"<think>Je prépare un jeu de plateforme interactif en HTML5/JavaScript.</think>Je comprends votre demande et je vais coder un jeu web interactif et complet, doté d'un design soigné et d'un gameplay fluide, directement livrable dans notre discussion.\n\n[SUITE]","ts":"2026-10-11T19:53:57.300Z"},{"id":"5t42vsrad0","role":"user","hidden":true,"text":"[SUITE] Ton message est affiché à l'écran. Travaille maintenant, sans le répéter : utilise les outils nécessaires, écris le code, livre le ou les fichiers, puis termine par un court message final. Avant chaque outil, écris une courte phrase visible.","ts":"2026-10-11T19:53:57.300Z"},{"id":"k9hry6two0","role":"user","text":"non","apiText":"non","attachments":[],"ts":"2026-10-11T19:55:59.521Z","hidden":false}]}